   "body": "I like the idea, thanks for sharing it!\r\n\r\nI guess a minimal implementation of this could be by hacking a OONI module based on the original code you linked to, even though this probably would be a very ghetto solution.\r\n\r\nI was independently thinking about collecting similar kind of metrics as part of measurement-kit implementation of web-connectivity, such that, basically, by running censorship measurements in country X one also gets for free HTTPS classification for those sites that are not blocked. As such, I have just created a ticket referring to this in measurement-kit: https://github.com/measurement-kit/measurement-kit/issues/1197.",
